[
    {
        "id": "5646d0725b2d5e9c",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "Grid Connection Status",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "GridConnectionStatusState\n\nMonitors grid connection by checking phase voltages.\nGrid is connected if any phase voltage > 150V.\n\nRegisters:\n- 698: Phase A Voltage (0.1V)\n- 699: Phase B Voltage (0.1V)\n- 700: Phase C Voltage (0.1V)\n\nRPC: getGridConnectionStatusState\nCronjob: Every 1 min, sends to ThingsBoard if gridConnected = false"
    },
    {
        "id": "3249d8ae1eb2823c",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "5646d0725b2d5e9c",
        "name": "══════ MODBUS READ ══════",
        "info": "",
        "x": 160,
        "y": 40,
        "wires": []
    },
    {
        "id": "9f174172d100a92e",
        "type": "modbus-flex-getter",
        "z": "5646d0725b2d5e9c",
        "name": "Read Grid Voltages",
        "showStatusActivities": true,
        "showErrors": true,
